## Phase 3: Authentication + Users Walkthrough

> [!NOTE]
> Phase 3 successfully implemented full-stack JWT-based authentication. We have established secure hashing on the backend, role-based protection, and built the "Dark Cosmic Mission Control" login and registration interfaces on the frontend.

### Work Completed

#### Backend
- **Security Utilities:** Created `hashPassword`, `comparePassword`, and `generateToken` (JWT) in `src/utils`.
- **Middleware:** Created `requireAuth` (JWT validation) and `requireRole` in `src/middleware/auth.js`.
- **Controllers & Routes:** Created endpoints for Registration, Login, and Profile fetching in `src/controllers/authController.js`. Mounted to `/api/auth`.

#### Frontend
- **API Client:** Setup an Axios instance with dynamic Authorization headers interceptors in `lib/apiClient.js`.
- **State Management:** Built `AuthContext` to handle user session, loading states, and auth actions.
- **Routing:** Configured React Router in `App.jsx` and created a `ProtectedRoute` component.
- **UI Pages Built:**
  - `Login.jsx` (Mission Control Login)
  - `Register.jsx` (Operative Registration)
  - `Profile.jsx` (Operative Profile)

