## Phase 5: Dashboard & Simulated Telemetry
Phase 5 focused on building the main fleet overview layout and implementing a realistic mock telemetry generator on the backend.

### What Was Built
- **Backend Service**: `telemetrySimulator.js` runs a background task every 10 seconds to generate and insert mock telemetry readings (Temp, Velocity, Altitude, etc.) for all active satellites.
- **Frontend Dashboard**: Built `Dashboard.jsx` featuring dynamic KPI cards (Active Satellites, Fleet Health Avg, Warnings, Critical/Offline) that aggregate global system health.
- **Live Telemetry Feed**: A real-time updating grid view within the Dashboard that periodically fetches the latest DB telemetry inserts and displays them using clean, monospace typography.

